Rationale: Absolute spectral medium IORs must survive camera/SSS/MNEE probes before interface ratios are formed; this also carries unrelated 5.3 Quaternion/shadow-type adaptations.
Contract: Store absolute wavelength-dependent medium IORs through camera, SSS and MNEE probes before forming interface ratios; preserve shared CPU/GPU spectral weights and adapt Quaternion attribute/shadow result types to Blender 5.3.
Tests: tests/houdini_spectral_nested_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

